# Reviewed exceptions for scripts/check_self_references.py — one per line,
# `<path relative to the repository root> <matched text>`. An entry covers
# every match of that text in that file; an entry matching nothing fails
# the gate, so remove it when the reference goes.
#
# The concierge prompt's worked examples use small issue/PR numbers as
# placeholders for the operator's own repository ("Reply on #12 that …",
# "How is PR #41 doing?"); they are not references into sbxloop's tracker.
